.el .ds Aq '
.TH ferry-identity-import 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-identity\-import \- Replace this device\*(Aqs key with one from a backup
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry identity import\fR [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Replace this device\*(Aqs key with one from a backup
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Replace an existing, different key (it is kept as a `.bak` file)
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>
Backup created by `ferry identity export`
